00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:24.591
Tucker Carlson texts

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.792
Laura Ingram

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:27.660
and says Sidney Powell is lying.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:28.828
By the way, I caught her.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:29.929
It's insane.

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:31.531
Ingram then responded to him.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.299
Sidney is a complete nut.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.367
No one will work with her.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:35.635
Ditto with Rudy.

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.669
And in the deposition,

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.238
Sean Hannity testified

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:39.472
that the whole narrative

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.840
that Sidney was pushing.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.143
I did not believe it for one second.

00:00:43.576 --> 00:00:45.211
Those texts and testimony

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:46.980
are part of a lawsuit by Dominion

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:47.914
Voting Systems

00:00:47.914 --> 00:00:51.584
suing Fox News for $1.6 billion

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.852
