00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.071
that their viewers were going away.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:11.838
I want to bring up

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.440
one other part of that.

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:15.675
The messages from this lawsuit.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:16.242
This is

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.445
