There'll be a headline

00:09:16.355 --> 00:09:18.791
in The New York Post, for example.

00:09:18.791 --> 00:09:20.026
Is there any reason to believe

00:09:20.026 --> 00:09:22.061
that the Trump Fox Alliance

00:09:22.061 --> 00:09:24.130
is actually in a different place?

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:24.897
Is it weaker?

00:09:24.897 --> 00:09:28.200
And what, a $1.6 billion verdict

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:29.702
affect it

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:34.807
regardless of the verdict?

00:09:34.807 --> 00:09:36.042
I think the trouble that they bear

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:37.610
in the enormous costs,

00:09:37.610 --> 00:09:38.578
the reputational cost

00:09:38.578 --> 00:09:40.046
and the financial cost

00:09:40.046 --> 00:09:41.280
of just defending themselves

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:42.114
in this lawsuit,

00:09:42.114 --> 00:09:42.782
I think

00:09:42.782 --> 00:09:44.350
has really sort of sobered up

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.452
the Murdoch organization.

00:09:46.452 --> 00:09:47.320
Rupert Murdoch himself

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.421
comes across in the filings,

00:09:48.421 --> 00:09:49.789
almost like Dr. Frankenstein.

00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:51.891
They've created this monster

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:54.260
and it is now spun out of their control.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.394
There's a very interesting

00:09:56.529 --> 00:09:56.963
New York

00:09:56.963 --> 00:09:59.665
Post editorial from November seven, 2020

00:09:59.799 --> 00:10:01.133
cited in the documents

00:10:01.133 --> 00:10:01.767
where he

00:10:01.767 --> 00:10:04.203
he pleads with President Trump,

00:10:04.203 --> 00:10:05.638
then President Trump,

00:10:05.638 --> 00:10:07.073
to to accept the results

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:08.040
and simply move on

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.709
and not tarnish his own legacy.

00:10:09.709 --> 00:10:11.711
That didn't it was unheeded.

00:10:11.711 --> 00:10:13.346
It was unheeded by his audience.

00:10:13.346 --> 00:10:15.381
It was unheeded by his organization.

00:10:15.381 --> 00:10:15.982
Ultimately,

00:10:15.982 --> 00:10:17.617
it led to this disastrous point

00:10:17.617 --> 00:10:19.352
where that they've arrived at.

00:10:19.352 --> 00:10:19.652
I think

00:10:19.652 --> 00:10:20.753
Rupert Murdoch himself

00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:21.988
understands very well

00:10:21.988 --> 00:10:22.622
that they need to go

00:10:22.622 --> 00:10:23.823
in another direction.

00:10:23.823 --> 00:10:24.857
The question is whether or not

00:10:24.857 --> 00:10:26.192
this financial beast

00:10:26.192 --> 00:10:28.260
that he has created this organization

00:10:28.494 --> 00:10:29.695
that is so dependent

00:10:29.695 --> 00:10:30.429
on catering

00:10:30.429 --> 00:10:32.031
to a select audience,

00:10:32.031 --> 00:10:34.266
whether or not they're willing to change

00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:36.569
and go back to basic newsgathering,

00:10:36.569 --> 00:10:37.503
if they can do that,

00:10:37.503 --> 00:10:38.871
they may be able to survive this.

